    "description": "E2E test collection for user feedback routes (src/routes/feedback_routes.py). Covers feedback submission (rating/category/message/feature-request/bug-report), the authenticated user's own feedback history, and the admin-only list/stats endpoints. Includes negative paths (no auth, missing/invalid body fields, non-admin access to admin endpoints) and a security probe for whether /submit trusts the user_id supplied in the body instead of the authenticated identity."
